WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.334
The robot arm moves from the top center to the right, grasps the blue can (alphabet soup) from above, lifts it, and places it into the basket on the left side of the table.

2
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Move arm to the right and descend to grasp the blue can from above.

3
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.000
Lift the blue can and move it to the left towards the basket.

4
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.500
Lower the can into the basket and open the gripper to release it.

5
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.000
Retract the arm upwards and to the right, away from the basket.
